-
-## Newton with line search
-
-The line-search algorithm applies a full Newton step, evaluates the residual, and then searches for a scale `eta`. Correct implementation requires each trial to represent exactly:
-
-```text
-u_trial = u_before + eta · Δu_Newton
-```
-
-and requires all spring/element history to be restored or incrementally advanced to the same eta. The current Regula Falsi bracket and final update violate that invariant (`ISSUE-01`).
