-| `>= 0` | Converged; value is the current iteration number |
-| `-1` | Continue iterating |
-| `-2` | Maximum iterations exceeded |
-| `-3` | Maximum displacement exceeded |
-| `-4` | Stop/NaN path used by algorithms |
-| `<= -10` | Integrator or line-search failure family |
-
-The top-level nonlinear solver currently replaces failed outcomes with return code zero after leaving the step loop (`ISSUE-02`).
