-## Commit and revert contract
-
-A converged step must commit:
-
-- total/global displacement;
-- integrator pseudo-time and multiplier/lambda;
-- external and P-Delta load state;
-- every element state;
-- every constitutive spring history.
-
-A failed step or trial line-search point must restore all of those values. Restoring only `u` is insufficient because force, tangent, energy, and loading-phase histories are path-dependent.
